  <!-- One line in the game's mods list: about 30 characters fit before it wraps. -->
  <String key="Mod.Description">Cloth flags that wave in the wind</String>
  <String key="Mod.Unsupported">
    RealFlag could not draw its flags on this computer, so it shows none in this city. Your
    flags stay in the city and in its saves.\n\n
    The mod needs Metal or OpenGL 3.3, and the game does not have either here.
  </String>
  <String key="Mod.UnsupportedWindows">
    RealFlag could not draw its flags on this computer, so it shows none in this city. Your
    flags stay in the city and in its saves.\n\n
    The mod needs DirectX 11. If the game is started with a launch option that changes its
    graphics (Steam: right-click the game, Properties, Launch Options), remove it and restart
    the game.\n\n
    If that is not it, please report it with the log file:\n{0}
  </String>

